---LINES

mainv   = hnx "main view"
mainvk  = c   "main view keys:"

cmded   = hnx "command editor"
cmdedk  = c   "command editor keys:"

exit    = hnx "exit trap"
exitk   = c   "keys of trap on exit:"

hist    = hnx   "history view"
histk   = c   "history view keys:"

runcmd  = hnx "run a command"

---# m       = gm  - - - - " *)"
m       = g  - - - - " *)"
a       = cx "{1}"
b       = cx "{2}"
c       = cx "{3}"

cmd     = hx "[a-z./]"
CMD     = hx "[A-Z0-9]"

---SCREEN
=vash workflow -- context switching                                      
+                                      please, see 'man vash' for more details       
+.mainvk...............................                                       
+ .:CA switch between editor and main       .:HE... - help      
+ .'uppercase                               .:EX... - exit,return     
+   execute predefined command   .a.        .:CA    - cancel                
+   edit a command from template .b.        
+ .'lowercase                               .mainv.............................
+   type a command from scratch  .c.        .CMD.... .cmd...           .:CA  ^  
+                                            :   :   :                   :   :  
+.cmdedk...............................     .a.  :   : .hist..........   :   :  
+ .:HE... switch to history view             :  .b.  :  .:NL...    :     :   :  
+ .:NL... run a command, sync history        :   :  .c.  :         :     :   :  
+                                            :   :   :   :     .:HE... .:CA  :  
+.histk................................      : .cmded......................  :  
+ .:CA    return to editor untouched         :   .:NL...          ^          :  
+ .:NL... take a command to editor           :     :              :          : 
+                                           .runcmd........      .c.         :  
+.exitk................................          -->      :       :        .:CA      
+ .:SP...| .:CA return to main view                       :     .cmd...  .:SP...       
+ .'lovercase  return to editor                           .exit................     
                                                                                
---END                                                                         
+  .:NL...  - defencive trap for mistakes   
+                                     .m. see 'man vash' for details
